/*
:name: aeg_tree_fold
:type: equiv
*/
// The tree aegraph (upass/aeg, todo 2a-treeaeg) with every rule on, against a golden that never went through
// it: shared sums read one name (x, y, z), a difference of one value is the constant 0 its reader takes (p), a
// compare of one value with itself is `true` (e), products by powers of two are shifts rewritten in place (m, n),
// and a const alias is read through its name (w). The pyrope-vs-pyrope aeg_tree_* groups LEC a forwarded
// compile against a forwarded one; the forwarding has no knob, so this golden is its independent reference.
// A `mod`: the step rewrites its body in place (a comb's shared body is inlined and cached as walked, so the step runs on its private lowering copy).
pub mod top(a:U8, b:U8, c:U8, s:S8) -> (x:U11@[0], y:U12@[0], z:U9@[0], p:S10@[0], m:U11@[0], n:S18@[0], e:Bool@[0], w:U9@[0]) {
  x = (a + b) * 3
  y = (b + a) * 5
  z = (a + b) ^ c
  p = (a + b) - (b + a)
  m = a * 8
  n = s * 1024
  e = (a + c) == (c + a)
  const t = a + c
  w = t
}
